<title>SWITZERLAND: Feldschloesschen sells SSG stake to Curti.</title>
<headline>Feldschloesschen sells SSG stake to Curti.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss brewing and mineral water group Feldschloesschen-Huerlimann Holding AG (FHH) said it had sold its 48.8 percent stake in catering group SSG Schweizerische Speisewagen-Gesellschaft to Curti &amp; Co AG.</p>
<p>&quot;Significant funds thus flow to the Feldschloesschen group,&quot; it said in a statement, but it did not disclose terms.</p>
<p>SSG employs around 2,100 workers and generated sales of 226 million Swiss francs in the 1995/1996 business year.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
